    {id = "b0023g01", blockID = 23, sourceBlock = 23, sourceGoal = 1, blockTitle = "Hive'Ashi: kill these as you meet them", sourceKind = "collect", uiMapID = 1451, x = 0.4184, y = 0.4413, coordFrame = "era", continentID = 1, worldX = -6983.4368308, worldY = 1080.0730544, questID = 8318, objectiveIndex = 1, itemID = 20404, itemName = "Encrypted Twilight Text", count = 10, questTitle = "Secret Communication", kind = "complete", text = "Collect Encrypted Twilight Text ×10 — Secret Communication", detail = "Sources: Twilight Avenger, Twilight Overlord, Twilight Stonecaller, Twilight Flamereaver, Twilight Geolord.\n\nThe Twilight's Hammer dig fills the north-west corner: tablet fragments lie on the ground and the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers carry them too. Every cultist can drop an Encrypted Twilight Text: keep twenty, ten for Bor Wildmane and ten for Hermit Ortell later.\n\nTwilight's Hammer cultists", index = 54},
